cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Faraday: a computational Faraday tensor for E-cross-H field coupling"
abstract: >-
  Faraday learns a reduced-order topological operator on FDFD-derived
  electromagnetic fingerprints: a Banach fixed-point coupling tensor that
  converges to machine epsilon. The method recovers the unified E-cross-H
  field coupling by topology-fixed-point projection rather than by direct
  solution of the full field problem.
